message: "If you use the historical FDR-KG software itself, please cite this software record. For the current JBI study and its numerical results, cite the JBI article and the versioned jbi-biomedical-reliability-screen release instead."
title: "FDR-KG: Statistical Quality Assurance for Knowledge Graph Link Prediction"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
